SUMMARY:All Ages Bingo
DESCRIPTION:All Ages. Gather your friends and family for an evening of friendly competition and lively entertainment. It’s all about the thrill of the game\, the possibility of winning fantastic prizes\, and creating memories that will bring smiles to your faces. Our bingo games are designed to engage participants of all ages\, making it a level playing field for everyone. Enjoy delicious snacks and refreshments\, all in a safe and welcoming environment. \nResident: $10 \nNon-resident: $12 \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/all-ages-bingo/2026-04-01/
