SUMMARY:Movie Night: The Super Mario Bros. Movie
DESCRIPTION:Bring the kids out for a fun family movie night as we play The Super Mario Bros. Movie on the big projector at 6 PM! We’ll have free popcorn for kids to enjoy during the movie\, plus 25+ food carts with plenty of tasty options for the whole family. A perfect\, easy evening out for parents and kids alike! 🌟 \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
